(39, 'les verbes du 1er groupe au présent de l\'indicatif آجي تفهم', 'les_verbes_du_1er_groupe_au_présent_de_lindicatif_آجي_تفهم', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/iFp9LDj65tI?si=dm5_I10HmN9FXAce', 'conjugaison7.webp', 'la conjugaison سلسلة آجي تفهم مزيان الحلقة 7', '', '', '', 'Apprendre le français,تعلم الفرنسية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', '4th Year of Primary School', 'all', 8, 75),
(40, 'les verbes du 2ème groupe au présent de l\'indicatif آجي تفهم', 'les_verbes_du_2ème_groupe_au_présent_de_lindicatif_آجي_تفهم', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Whj7rxO-CSU?si=3oR0xhoytsvaGVdF', 'conjugaison8.webp', 'الحلقة 8 : la conjugaison سلسلة آجي تفهم مزيان \r\n', '', '', '', 'Apprendre le français,تعلم الفرنسية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', '4th Year of Primary School', 'all', 8, 75),
(41, 'The 7 Meanings of “DROP” in English', 'The_7_Meanings_of_DROP_in_English', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/_Z-j-sJvf34?si=yEEfYR0PxXpIcM4T', 'learn_english1.webp', 'Do you know the many meanings of the simple word “drop”? English speakers use this verb in at least 6 different ways, most of which are slang! It can mean to lose a phone connection, spend a lot of money, release a product, or knock someone over. “Drop” also refers to something falling down by mistake, and to things we are not allowed to write about here anymore. Join me now and learn to use and understand the many meanings of this common English verb. 1', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English,تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(42, 'Can you guess the verb?', 'Can_you_guess_the_verb', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/J0NpmKDt1o8?si=3BAWrfrjh_haEXaR', 'learn_english2.webp', 'Learn how to use this single verb in 12 different English expressions and phrasal verbs. These are all short and easy expressions to learn, and they are satisfying to say. Learn these expressions and start using them with friends, colleagues, your grandmother, diplomats, and baristas today. \r\n', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English,تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(43, 'Have natural and DRAMATIC conversations by using HYPERBOLE!', 'Have_natural_and_DRAMATIC_conversations_by_using_HYPERBOLE', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/1gsy3jJdQIo?si=VN03ivvTBIqiQWiw', 'learn_english3.webp', 'Do you know what hyperbole is? Do you know how to use it in English conversations the way native speakers do? In this vocabulary class, you’ll learn how English speakers use exaggerated words to be dramatic in a funny and informal way. I’ll give you lots of examples so you can start using hyperbole in your own conversations right after this class. Take the quiz at ', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English,تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(44, 'How to talk about prices in English - Basic Vocabulary', 'How_to_talk_about_prices_in_English__Basic_Vocabulary', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/ug-xjtExqKA?si=9toHBx67o1mxHtVU', 'learn_english4.webp', 'http://www.engvid.com/ Let\'s go shopping and talk about money! You don\'t need to say something costs \"five dollars and ninety-eight cents\"! We shorten everything. This basic English vocabulary lesson will teach you how to understand prices, and say them like a native speaker! Test your skills with the quiz here:/\r\n', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English,تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(46, 'Speaking English - Going to the dentist', 'Speaking_English__Going_to_the_dentist', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/cbH9avLPanU?si=1zuUhnzR1a_o9NX7', 'learn_english7.webp', 'http://www.engvid.com/ Do you hate going to the dentist? I LOVE going to the dentist! The dentist is a doctor for your teeth. In this English vocabulary lesson, you\'ll learn lots of words that you will hear at the dentist\'s office. I\'ll teach you the words for different parts of your mouth, problems you can have with them, and some of the tools the dentist will use to fix them! Don\'t forget to brush your quiz and to take the teeth. Oops, I mean brush your teeth and take the quiz. ...\r\n', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English,تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(49, 'Basic English Grammar- Have, Has, Had', 'Basic_English_Grammar_Have_Has_Had', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Nd4MScADY94?si=5hY_CPX1mWc1QLGR', 'learn_english14.webp', 'This lesson teaches you about the easily and often mixed-up English verb \"have\"! \r\n', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(50, 'English Vocabulary & Phrasal Verbs for strange things we do', 'English_Vocabulary_Phrasal_Verbs_for_strange_things_we_do', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/1-UpOyrCnf4?si=wNv_VRGlrZ3x9iaS', 'learn-english15.webp', 'People are strange! Why do we do so many weird things? I don’t know, but I can teach you some good words and phrasal verbs to talk about strange behaviour. Or maybe you don’t care about strange things. In that case, just stay with me and learn some new words! I’ll teach you the difference between “press” and “click on”, “stare at” and “look for”, as well as slang like “gitch”. When you’re taking a lesson with me, you always need to remember to pack extra gitch.', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-07 20:32:35', 'Unknown', 'all', 8, 75),
(51, 'INTERNET DATING SLANG- hook up, sexting, Netflix & chill...', 'INTERNET_DATING_SLANG_hook_up_sexting_Netflix_chill', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Z6JZ_JP_4vk?si=1s2fWP_DVD6u9NQc', 'learn-english16.webp', 'Want to hook up? You’ll need to know the slang used on dating apps. I’m here to help. In this very important, very serious lesson, I will teach you some slang and acronyms commonly used in the world of Internet dating. You will learn the meaning of words like “ghosting”, “breadcrumbing”, “benching”, “Netflix & chill”, “hook up”, “catfishing”, “sexting”, and more. I will also give you a list of acronyms to describe yourself on your profile. For example, you may say you are a “AGM, N/S, D&D free, and looking for LTR”. Watch the lesson to find out what this means, and be sure to describe yourself in acronyms in the comments below! If you’re taking the IELTS, why not get laid first? ', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-07 20:32:46', 'Unknown', 'all', 14, 75),
(52, 'English Vocabulary & Slang- SCORE!!!', 'English_Vocabulary_Slang_SCORE', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/q80zZyapttY?si=eoQfD4QmS2JDOi1A', 'learn-english17.webp', 'Watch to learn the MANY uses of the word ‘score’ in English. I’ll teach you the different meanings of this one versatile word, which can be a noun, a verb, or even an adjective. If you already know these, watch on because I’ll also show you some surprising slang uses of the same word. They involve s#x and dr$gs. Do I have your attention now? Scooooore!!! \r\n', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-06 19:26:37', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(53, 'Sound more natural in English- CHA, CHA, CHA!', 'Sound_more_natural_in_English_CHA_CHA_CHA', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/q1mcBgn2O4I?si=B4bUHDC6OLC6GHkb', 'learn-english18.webp', 'Learn how we smash some words in English together, making a “CHA” sound. If you try to say these words the way they are written, you will sound unnatural or extremely formal. You need to learn how native English speakers collapse sounds and words in everyday speech. We don’t spell these phrases with “cha”, but we do pronounce them that way. To help you perfect your pronunciation and sound more natural, I will teach you six instances of the “cha” sound in English in the following common phrases: get you, got you, bet you, don’t you, what are you, and want you. Learning these will help you sound more like a native English speaker, so “whatcha” waiting for?', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(54, '♥ ♥ ♥ 16 Common English LOVE Expressions ♥ ♥ ♥', '16_Common_English_LOVE_Expressions', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/iMWPK-UqZjU?si=6F_cPe_WMwDkdtO4', 'learn-english19.webp', 'If you like someone, you might want to let that person know. Or maybe you are already in a relationship and want to talk about it with your friends. To help you express yourself, watch this lesson all about expressions and slang to do with  love and relationships. I will teach you sayings like \"have a crush on someone\", \"play hard to get\", \"hook up\", \"tie the knot\", and more. These are commonly used expressions by native English speakers. Be sure to watch because I will also give you my advice on good and bad behavior in dating. BEHAVE YOURSELVES or Ronnie will get mad!', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-06 19:27:01', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(55, 'SLANG words using \'bug\' in English', 'SLANG_words_using_bug_in_English', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/eOCSzEPOKNY?si=VyrwmC20CwyLA25j', 'learn-english20.webp', 'Native English speakers use the word \"bug\" in slang a lot. And no, it has nothing to do with insects! In this lesson, I will teach you many ways to use the word \"bug\" as a noun, as an adjective, and as a verb. For example, we will look at what it means when someone \"bugs you\" or what might be wrong if your phone is \"bugged\". Computers can also have \"bugs\". Don\'t get \"bugged out\", though, because I will explain everything in the video. To help you remember this common slang term and start using it in your own conversations, make sure you do the quiz at-...\r\n', 'english', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(56, 'Learn this English slang- go-to, hit it, rock up', 'Learn_this_English_slang_goto_hit_it_rock_up', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/2NWoqGPCHCw?si=hx9AlErt2AVkrPiy', 'learn-english21.webp', 'SLANG, SLANG, SLANG. I LOVE SLANG. I\'m going to teach you some slang today that I hear a lot and use a lot NOW. You won\'t learn this from a book, because these are ways of speaking that are popular right now. You can use it in casual conversations to sound like a native English speaker. If you are not comfortable using it, at least you will understand when you hear other people saying these phrases in real life or in movies. I will teach you three slang phrases that are commonly used in English-speaking countries: \"go-to\", \"hit it\", and \"rock up\". After watching, make sure to rock up to the EngVid website at ', 'ENGLISH', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(57, 'Have SAFE SEX with Ronnie!', 'Have_SAFE_SEX_with_Ronnie', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/MRtZuzyHW6Q?si=ncYqaopEZl0ohMHo', 'learn-english22.webp', 'Want to have sex? DO IT SAFELY! In this sex education video, I\'m going to teach you about SAFE SEX -- how to have sex without an accidental pregnancy or getting sexually transmitted diseases (STDs). You will learn about safe sex, but also learn the English vocabulary and slang terms used to talk about this topic. Even though sex is so common and such an important part of life, I haven\'t seen any English textbooks that teach this material, and it\'s not often taught in English classes either! Well, that\'s why I\'m here! Sex is a wonderful thing, but it is VERY important that you are educated on how to protect yourself and your partners. I\'ll talk about different types of birth control, like condoms, IUDs, and the pill, as well as the importance of getting tested so that your sex life can be happy and healthy. You\'ll also learn about some common sexually transmitted diseases, and the slang terms that native English speakers use to talk about them. Have sex, be safe, have fun, and have more sex. And remember: \"She won\'t get sick if you cover your dick\".\r\n', 'ENGLISH', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 14, 75),
(58, 'Phrasal Verbs of SEX', 'Phrasal_Verbs_of_SEX', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/40ztSkf2zEA?si=9FDN8RI5kQE-PZB7', 'learn-english23.webp', 'Let\'s talk about sex, baby! In this video, I\'ll teach you the phrasal verbs that we use to talk about having sex in English. We\'ll look at common slang phrasal verbs like \"go down on\", \"feel up\", and \"beat off\". I\'ll also talk about the culture of sex, what to say, what not to say, and how to say it. You\'ll learn vocabulary like \"spooge\", \"jizz\", and \"ejaculate\". Don\'t be embarrassed, and don\'t embarrass yourself! Have sex like a Canadian! Check out this lesson and take the quiz at  bedroom-ready! Let\'s get it on!\r\n', 'ENGLISH', '', '', 'Learn English, تعلم الإنجليزية, تعلم الانجليزية', 'ltr', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-01-03 15:50:12', 'Unknown', 'all', 14, 75),
(59, 'دودة غيرت وجه التاريخ | البلهاريسيا في مصر', 'دودة_غيرت_وجه_التاريخ_البلهاريسيا_في_مصر', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/Uu3dL2_MMpw?si=pw0DjONsXIlwCuYg', 'learn-english24.webp', '\r\n126 115 vues  30 sept. 2022  #الاسبتالية\r\nعاشت في نيل مصر من أكتر من خمسة آلاف سنة \r\nولحد من مئة سنة فاتت كانت عايشة في لحم ودم تلات ارباع المصريين \r\nغيرت ولسة بتشكل في ملامح الصحة العامة في مصر لحد انهاردة\r\nأصيب واتوفى بيها الملايين منهم عبدالحليم حافظ \r\nوغنى لها عمرو دياب\r\nحكاية دودة غيرت وجه التاريخ \r\n البلهاريسيا في مصر\r\n', 'ST', '', '', 'صحة وحياة,أصناف أخرى', 'rtl', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-06 19:27:19', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(60, 'الوباء الذي قتل ١٪ من سكان مصر 🇪🇬', 'الوباء_الذي_قتل_١_من_سكان_مصر_🇪🇬', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/LhwoPhuVysk?si=VFlWJXG-nEI1yYfj', 'learn-ST25.webp', '\r\nكتاب \"الوباء الذي قتل 180 ألف مصري\"\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n', 'ST', '', '', 'صحة وحياة, أصناف أخرى', 'rtl', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-02-02 17:21:03', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(61, 'خطر المضادات الحيوية !', 'خطر_المضادات_الحيوية_', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/W5q5QRwxsgI?si=uQ5EOi14IIUd_22G', 'learn-ST26.webp', '\r\n153 717 vues  19 nov. 2021\r\nما هي الميكروبات المقاومة للمضادات الحيوية ؟ كيف تحدث وما هي عواقبها ؟\r\nوليه تعتبر مقاومة المضادات الحيوية مشكلة بتمسنا كلنا ؟\r\n', 'ST', '', '', 'صحة وحياة', 'rtl', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-02-02 17:21:03', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(62, 'سم الزرنيخ ! سم الملوك وملك السموم ⚠️', 'سم_الزرنيخ_سم_الملوك_وملك_السموم', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/a7MgW785tcg?si=3Znp2Umd8z2LoG1S', 'learn-ST28.webp', '\r\nالسم اللي استخدم في اقدم جرايم القتل والاغتيالات السياسية على مر التاريخ\r\nاستخدمه بعض ورثة عرش الحضارة الرومانية الصينية القديمة لتصفية بعضهم البعض بسبب الخلافات السياسية\r\nوفي العصور الوسطى في اوروبا كان جزء لا يتجزأ من الحياة السياسية ونظام انتقال الحكم\r\nووجدت كميات مهولة منه في جثة نابيلون بونابرت بعد موته في ظروف غامضة\r\n( سم الملوك ) أو (ملك السموم)\r\n', 'ST', '', '', 'صحة وحياة', 'rtl', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-06 19:27:33', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(63, 'إنسولين | حكاية 100 سنة 💉', 'إنسولين_حكاية_100_سنة', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/eap75rbCaPU?si=qXY-Q4-vH2RbDC92', 'learn-ST29.webp', '\r\nقصة الإنسولين اللي بدأت من 100 سنة.. إيه اللي حصل خلالهم ومنتظرين إيه في المستقبل ؟\r\nأكثر  من 400 مليون مريض بالسكر يعتمد في علاجه على الإنسولين.. وأكثر من نصف المرضى لا يمكنهم الوصول للإنسولين في الوقت المناسب وبالجرعات المناسبة\r\n تعمل منظمة #أطباء بلا حدود على توفير سبل توزيع وحفظ أبسط للإنسولين ليتكمن المرضى في مناطق النزاعات والحروب والمناطق الأكثر فقرًا من التعامل ', 'ST', '', '', 'صحة وحياة', 'rtl', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-06 19:27:43', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(64, 'فيتامين سي | مناعة حقيقية ضد أدوار البرد أم مجرد أكذوبة ؟ | الاسبتالية', 'فيتامين_سي_مناعة_حقيقية_ضد_أدوار_البرد_أم_مجرد_أكذوبة_الاسبتالية', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/DNOohD_SaiQ?si=y8CwnMfxJqWm5whn', 'learn-ST30.webp', '\r\n146 834 vues  7 oct. 2023  #الاسبتالية\r\nالحقيقة وراء مفعول فيتامين سي .. هل يساعد في رفع المناعة ؟ هل يحمي ضد أدوار البرد ؟ وهل يقي ضد السرطان وأمراض القلب ؟\r\n', 'ST', '', '', 'صحة وحياة', 'rtl', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-06 19:28:08', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
(65, 'بوتوكس | سم ولا علاج ؟', 'بوتوكس_سم_ولا_علاج', 'https://www.youtube.com/embed/y8ECzIT93v8?si=LdtzVBe-5UXxuVOO', 'learn-ST31.webp', '\r\nقام بكتابة الحلقة الزميل الدكتور محمد صلاح سرور المتخصص في علم الأحياء التطورية والذي يقوم بنشر العديد من المقالات الشيقة والممتعة في هذا المجال على صفحته على فيسبوك\r\nتقدرو تقرأو أكتر من خلال اللينك', 'ST', '', '', 'صحة وحياة', 'rtl', 'public', '2024-10-24', '2025-03-06 19:28:26', 'Unknown', 'all', 2, 75),
